/*
 * Windows.Storage.Search.IQueryOptionsFactory, declared here rather than in
 * include/windows.storage.idl.
 *
 * include/windows.storage.idl has IQueryOptions but not the activation factory interface, and the
 * IID is fixed by the Windows metadata, so declaring it locally is equivalent to having it there -
 * the only thing that matters to a caller is the uuid and the method order.
 *
 * Copyright 2026 the Wine project authors
